Patch Precedent
===============

This project includes references to and short excerpts of relatedb/relate
(https://github.com/relatedb/relate), which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, at commit 5f7a510713c3feac146133e77d8c5bb72bae1b11:

- Decision text from ADR-0585 (docs/adr/0585-installer-downloads-via-direct-route.md),
  paraphrased in evidence/installer.toml.
- Line references and check descriptions from scripts/tests/test_install_sh.sh.
- Diff context from distribution/install.sh, appearing in the patches under
  fixtures/installer/.

The two patches in fixtures/installer/ (wording.patch and release-lookup.patch)
are authored demonstration inputs written against Relate's code. They are not
upstream changes.

The upstream repository is fetched at run time into a local cache and is not
vendored in this repository.

